# Hyperliquid Direct DeFi Withdrawer - Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# For maximum security, do NOT save your production private key to disk.
# The CLI wizard and Web GUI prompt for your key interactively in-memory,
# calculate EIP-712 cryptographic signatures locally, and never persist keys.
